{'symbol': 'AXON', 'date': '2023-06-08 07:30:00', 'title': 'CHRISTUS HEALTH BECOMES LATEST HEALTH NETWORK TO DEPLOY AXON BODY CAMERAS TO ENHANCE HOSPITAL SECURITY', 'text': "AXON BODY 3 CAMERAS WILL BE DEPLOYED TO HOSPITAL SECURITY IN OVER 60 ACUTE CARE HEALTH CENTERS TO PROMOTE A SAFER HOSPITAL ENVIRONMENT SCOTTSDALE, ARIZ. , JUNE 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 AXON (NASDAQ: AXON), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN CONNECTED PUBLIC SAFETY TECHNOLOGIES, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT CHRISTUS HEALTH WILL EQUIP HOSPITAL SECURITY OFFICERS ACROSS THEIR NETWORK OF HOSPITAL CAMPUSES WITH AXON BODY 3 BODY-WORN CAMERAS AND LICENSES TO AXON'S DIGITAL EVIDENCE MANAGEMENT SYSTEM, AXON EVIDENCE."}